  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 02d6514f2a2cae245bd2bc883f4b069c, type: 3}
  m_Name: Cinematic_AureliaGarden
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Edenfall.Runtime::Edenfall.Cinematics.CinematicSceneData
  sceneId: cg_aurelia_garden
  titleVi: "Kh\u1EAFc Kh\u1EAFc B\xECnh Y\xEAn D\u01B0\u1EDBi \xC1nh Tr\u0103ng"
  titleEn: Moonlit Sanctuary Solace
  characterId: aurelia
  characterName: Aurelia
  descriptionVi: "Kho\u1EA3nh kh\u1EAFc l\xE3ng m\u1EA1n b\xEAn Aurelia t\u1EA1i
    ban c\xF4ng V\u01B0\u1EDDn B\xECnh Minh d\u01B0\u1EDBi l\xE0n gi\xF3 ng\xE1t
    h\u01B0\u01A1ng hoa ly v\xE0 b\u1EA7u tr\u1EDDi sao v\u1EE5n v\u1EE1."
  descriptionEn: An intimate evening in Dawn Garden with Aurelia beneath cascading
    celestial lilies and shattered constellations.
  minAffection: 20
  minTrust: 0
  hasTimeRequirement: 0
  requiredTimeOfDay: 2
  requiredLocationId: 
  slides:
  - characterEmotion: 6
    narrationVi: "Gi\xF3 \u0111\xEAm n\u01A1i V\u01B0\u1EDDn B\xECnh Minh ph\u1EA3ng
      ph\u1EA5t h\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u01A1m ng\xE0o ng\u1EA1t c\u1EE7a hoa ly tinh
      t\xFA. Aurelia t\u1EF1a m\xECnh v\xE0o lan can c\u1EA9m th\u1EA1ch tr\u1EAFng,
      \u0111\xF4i m\u1EAFt m\u01A1 m\xE0ng nh\xECn v\u1EC1 nh\u1EEFng h\xF2n \u0111\u1EA3o
      bay l\u01A1 l\u1EEDng gi\u1EEFa v\xF4 t\u1EADn."
    narrationEn: The night air in Dawn Garden is thick with the sweet scent of blooming
      celestial lilies. Aurelia stands by the white balustrade, gazing toward drifting
      islands in the void.
    dialogueVi: "M\u1ED7i khi nh\xECn v\xE0o kho\u1EA3ng kh\xF4ng v\xF4 t\u1EADn
      \u1EA5y... ta l\u1EA1i t\u1EF1 h\u1ECFi li\u1EC7u thi\xEAn \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
      n\xE0y c\xF3 th\u1EF1c s\u1EF1 c\u1EA7n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c c\u1EE9u r\u1ED7i,
      hay v\u1EA1n v\u1EADt ch\u1EC9 \u0111ang m\u1EC7t m\u1ECFi mu\u1ED1n ch\xECm
      v\xE0o gi\u1EA5c ng\u1EE7 ngh\xECn thu?"
    dialogueEn: Every time I look into the void... I wonder if paradise truly wants
      to be saved, or if it is merely exhausted.
    cameraEffect: 0
    cgSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - characterEmotion: 2
    narrationVi: "Khi b\u1EA1n b\u01B0\u1EDBc t\u1EDBi b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh, nh\u1EEFng
      ng\xF3n tay nh\u1EB9 nh\xE0ng ch\u1EA1m v\xE0o t\xE0 \xE1o l\u1EE5a m\u1EC1m
      m\u1EA1i c\u1EE7a n\xE0ng. M\u1ED9t l\xE0n s\xF3ng b\u1ED1i r\u1ED1i kh\u1EBD
      l\u01B0\u1EDBt qua \xE1nh m\u1EAFt Aurelia, nh\u01B0ng n\xE0ng kh\xF4ng h\u1EC1
      r\xFAt tay l\u1EA1i."
    narrationEn: As you step beside her, your fingers lightly brush against the soft
      silk of her sleeve. A subtle tremor passes through her breath, yet she does
      not draw away.
    dialogueVi: "Ng\u01B0\u01A1i lu\xF4n mang \u0111\u1EBFn c\u1EA3m gi\xE1c ki\xEAn
      \u0111\u1ECBnh v\xE0 t\u0129nh l\u1EB7ng \u1EA5y, Echo. Gi\u1EEFa m\u1ED9t
      th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi \u0111\u1ED5 n\xE1t v\xE0 nh\u1EEFng ti\u1EBFng th\xE9t
      g\xE0o c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1o lo\u1EA1n... \u1EDF b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh ng\u01B0\u01A1i
      khi\u1EBFn l\xF2ng ta b\xECnh y\xEAn l\u1EA1 th\u01B0\u1EDDng."
    dialogueEn: You have that quiet resolve, Echo. In a realm full of shattering
      skies and warlords, your presence is... soothing.
    cameraEffect: 2
    cgSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - characterEmotion: 3
    narrationVi: "Aurelia quay h\u1EB3n ng\u01B0\u1EDDi l\u1EA1i, v\u01B0\u01A1ng
      mi\u1EC7n ho\xE0ng kim tr\xEAn m\xE1i t\xF3c n\xE0ng t\u1ECFa ra h\u01A1i \u1EA5m
      thu\u1EA7n khi\u1EBFt c\u1EE7a v\u1EA7ng th\xE1i d\u01B0\u01A1ng. N\xE0ng kh\u1EBD
      v\u01B0\u01A1n b\xE0n tay thon th\u1EA3, \u0111an ch\u1EB7t nh\u1EEFng ng\xF3n
      tay v\xE0o tay b\u1EA1n."
    narrationEn: She turns to face you completely. The tiara in her golden hair glows
      with pure solar warmth. She extends her slender hand, entwining her fingers
      with yours.
    dialogueVi: "H\xE3y h\u1EE9a v\u1EDBi ta m\u1ED9t \u0111i\u1EC1u, Echo c\u1EE7a
      ta. D\xF9 c\xE1nh c\u1ED5ng Nh\u1EADt Th\u1EF1c ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc c\xF3
      mang l\u1EA1i b\u1EA5t c\u1EE9 tai \u01B0\u01A1ng n\xE0o... ng\u01B0\u01A1i
      c\u0169ng s\u1EBD m\xE3i \u1EDF c\u1EA1nh ta, c\xF3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c kh\xF4ng?"
    dialogueEn: Promise me one thing, my Echo. Whatever happens when the Eclipse
      Gate opens... you will stay by my side, will you?
    cameraEffect: 3
    cgSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - characterEmotion: 11
    narrationVi: "Hai ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u1EE9ng s\xE1t b\xEAn nhau tr\xEAn ban
      c\xF4ng l\u1ED9ng gi\xF3, nh\u1EEFng c\xE1nh hoa r\u01A1i l\u1EA5p l\xE1nh
      nh\u01B0 b\u1EE5i sao bao ph\u1EE7 l\u1EA5y c\xE1i \xF4m d\u1ECBu d\xE0ng v\xE0
      l\u1EDDi \u01B0\u1EDBc th\u1EC1 v\u01B0\u1EE3t qua c\u1EA3 s\u1EF1 s\u1EE5p
      \u0111\u1ED5 c\u1EE7a thi\xEAn \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng."
    narrationEn: The two of you stand close together on the moonlit terrace as glowing
      petals drift around you, sealed by an embrace that transcends the fall of paradise.
    dialogueVi: "C\u1EA3m \u01A1n ng\u01B0\u01A1i \u0111\xE3 t\u1EC9nh gi\u1EA5c,
      Echo... L\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn sau ba tr\u0103m n\u0103m c\xF4 \u0111\u1ED9c,
      tr\xE1i tim ta l\u1EA1i th\u1EA5y \u1EA5m \xE1p \u0111\u1EBFn nh\u01B0\u1EDDng
      n\xE0y."
    dialogueEn: Thank you for awakening, my Echo. For the first time in centuries,
      my heart feels warmth once more.
    cameraEffect: 4
    cgSprite: {fileID: 0}
  bonusAffection: 15
  bonusTrust: 15
  completionMemoryVi: "\u0110\xE3 c\xF9ng Aurelia th\u1EC1 \u01B0\u1EDBc m\u1ED9t
    l\xF2ng b\xEAn ban c\xF4ng ng\u1EADp \xE1nh hoa ly."
  completionMemoryEn: Shared an intimate vow beneath the celestial lilies with Aurelia.
